cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Copypaw in your work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Copypaw"
abstract: >-
  Copy a real pet's motion and paste it onto a drawing. Copypaw reads a
  side-view pet clip with CPU-only two-dimensional pose estimation and
  retargets the motion onto a drawing's strokes.
version: 0.1.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/intesarjawad/copypaw"
authors:
  - family-names: Jawad
    given-names: Intesar
keywords:
  - animation
  - pose estimation
  - motion transfer
  - children's drawings
